  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c7/Tricolored_Heron.png/revision/latest?cb=20260710224511\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tricolored Heron\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tricolored Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"443\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tricolored Heron</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Needs </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">any one:<br><span><a href=\"/wiki/bell-pepper-29901\" title=\"Bell Pepper\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bell Pepper\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e2/Bell_Pepper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20240218150145\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/blueberries-36310\" title=\"Blueberries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueberries\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/af/Blueberries.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250622152858\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-30746\" title=\"Broccoli\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Broccoli\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><br><p><span><a href=\"/wiki/cabbage-34832\" title=\"Cabbage\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cabbage\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/rice-8896\" title=\"Rice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rice\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><br><span><a href=\"/wiki/sesame-31883\" title=\"Sesame\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sesame\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Strawberry\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><br><span><a href=\"/wiki/sunflower-28399\" title=\"Sunflower\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sunflower\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span><a href=\"/wiki/watermelon-29902\" title=\"Watermelon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watermelon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 40</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Chick Voucher</span><span title=\"Chick voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" title=\"Chick Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>9 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>8</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> N/A</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<b>Tricolored Heron</b> are pet <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 20.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>\nThey give players <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points in exchange for any available feed.</p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Bird_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20211021162031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"213\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Bird_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20211021162031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird house\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Bird_House.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20211021162031\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"213\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABird_House.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Bird house</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Each Tricolored heron costs 8 purple <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a> and 9 chick <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>. They must be placed near a <a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bird house</a> to be bought. Players can have one Tricolored heron.\nHeron and bird houses can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a>. <span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Feeding</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f1/Bird_House_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20220118102209\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Giving feed\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" height=\"198\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f1/Bird_House_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20220118102209\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Giving feed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f1/Bird_House_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/230?cb=20220118102209\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" height=\"198\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABird_House_2.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Giving feed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>When given certain quantity of <a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Soybean</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Carrot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Strawberry</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/sesame-31883\" title=\"Sesame\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sesame</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/rice-8896\" title=\"Rice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rice</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/cabbage-34832\" title=\"Cabbage\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cabbage</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/sunflower-28399\" title=\"Sunflower\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sunflower</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/bell-pepper-29901\" title=\"Bell Pepper\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bell Pepper</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-30746\" title=\"Broccoli\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Broccoli</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/watermelon-29902\" title=\"Watermelon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watermelon</a>, heron eat then roam the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> for 6 hours and finally fall asleep. Players can immediately wake them up to receive 40 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per animal. Heron stay asleep otherwise.\n</p><p>Heron which have been woken up but are not fed for a long while cannot fall asleep and wander around their shelter looking very sleepy and tired.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pets-17088\" title=\"Category:Pets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/agami-heron-35866\" title=\"Agami Heron\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Agami Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/american-flamingo-36078\" title=\"American Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"American Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/anatolian-donkey-10430\" title=\"Anatolian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Anatolian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-donkey-11356\" title=\"Andalusian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-horse-2698\" title=\"Andalusian Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andean-flamingo-36051\" title=\"Andean Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andean Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-eleme